              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hariho busha obundi obubaho omu nsi; hariho abahikiriire abahikwaho ebyakushemereire ebi ababi bakora, kandi hariho ababi abahikwaho ebyakushemereire ebi abahikiriire bakora. Nikwo kugira nti: Ekyo nakyo ni busha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
